I did not receive an error. What version of the package are you using? Please update brainGraph and try again. The function had been updated to work for situations such as yours (i.e., where the input graph does not have a "btwn.cent" vertex attribute). If you do not wish to update, try the following:

V(Subj1)$btwn.cent <- centr_betw(Subj1)$res

Otherwise, to update:
devtools::install_github('cwatson/brainGraph')

Chris

